{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some secrets are buried for a reason\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You return to your uncle\u2019s house, expecting familiarity. But the house is empty. And then you notice the well. Something is waiting\u2026 something you weren\u2019t meant to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into a world of shadows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room hides a mystery. Every corridor whispers a story. Solve intricate puzzles, explore hidden passages, and piece together fragments of a life you thought you knew. The house itself seems alive, watching, waiting\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig deeper. Discover more.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the old well, layer by layer, unearthing objects, cryptic messages, and hidden secrets. Each layer brings new discoveries and challenges, revealing parts of a story you may not be ready for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the path to the unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect six elusive digits scattered throughout the house to unlock the elevator that leads deep below. Every puzzle solved and clue discovered increases the tension, guiding you toward a truth that could change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face what was hidden</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend further, reality and memory begin to blur. Shadows of your past collide with long-buried secrets. The ultimate revelation waits in the depths, testing your courage and your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological thriller and horror with a gripping story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious house filled with puzzles and hidden clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive digging mechanics revealing layers of secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable paths leading to shocking revelations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric visuals and immersive sound design that keep you on edge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dig deep enough to uncover the truth\u2026 or will the past consume you?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940890?t=1757079265","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940890?t=1757079265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940890/58263bc60ccf91ac42c1940a43ed9f5a8681c3ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757079265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940890/58263bc60ccf91ac42c1940a43ed9f5a8681c3ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757079265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some secrets are buried for a reason\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You return to your uncle\u2019s house, expecting familiarity. But the house is empty. And then you notice the well. Something is waiting\u2026 something you weren\u2019t meant to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into a world of shadows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room hides a mystery. Every corridor whispers a story. Solve intricate puzzles, explore hidden passages, and piece together fragments of a life you thought you knew. The house itself seems alive, watching, waiting\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig deeper. Discover more.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the old well, layer by layer, unearthing objects, cryptic messages, and hidden secrets. Each layer brings new discoveries and challenges, revealing parts of a story you may not be ready for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the path to the unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect six elusive digits scattered throughout the house to unlock the elevator that leads deep below. Every puzzle solved and clue discovered increases the tension, guiding you toward a truth that could change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face what was hidden</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend further, reality and memory begin to blur. Shadows of your past collide with long-buried secrets. The ultimate revelation waits in the depths, testing your courage and your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological thriller and horror with a gripping story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious house filled with puzzles and hidden clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive digging mechanics revealing layers of secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable paths leading to shocking revelations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric visuals and immersive sound design that keep you on edge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dig deep enough to uncover the truth\u2026 or will the past consume you?</p>","developers":["AtarioVanix"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940890/22a79bf0c463bc9ddbdf75462ccc76cd66f197ee/header.jpg?t=1757079265","is_free":false,"legal_not